The CBSA must keep up with new technology. I accept that the CBSA had valid reasons for wishing to switch from the BI GPS device to the OS GPS device. Those reasons included:
· the OS GPS device allows indoor tracking, using both GPS and cellular signals;
· its software is "substantially better";
· the OS GPS device does not require a dedicated telephone line or a base unit; and
· the OS GPS device does not require any handheld unit.
